      "tag": "Stop 1",
      "h2": "Mixing inputs",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">Your brain blends sense data.</p><p>Flavour = taste + smell + texture + sight + memory. 🍕</p><p>That's why hot chips look, smell and crunch right.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 2",
      "h2": "Synaesthesia",
      "body_html": "<p>About 4% of people have <span class=\"hl p\">synaesthesia</span> — senses cross-wire.</p><ul><li>Hearing music in colours.</li><li>Tasting words.</li><li>Seeing numbers with personalities.</li></ul><p>It's harmless and often fun. 🌈</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 3",
      "h2": "Adaptation",
      "body_html": "<p>Senses <span class=\"hl y\">adapt</span> — a smell or sound fades when constant.</p><p>You stop smelling your own perfume after a few minutes.</p><p>Adaptation lets the brain notice <b>new</b> things instead of old ones. 💡</p>"
    }
  ],
